---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Ming Lab at City University of Hong Kong studies cancer mechanisms, epigenetics, spatial tumor-nerve interactions and AI-assisted approaches for translational cancer research.
permalink: /
fullBleed: true
---
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="home-label">Ming Lab · Department of Biomedical Sciences</p>
      <h1>From cancer mechanisms to spatial tumor-nerve biology.</h1>
      <p class="home-lede">We investigate how genetic, epigenetic and spatial tissue-level mechanisms shape cancer progression, combining wet-lab molecular experiments with bioinformatics and AI-assisted analysis.</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="home-summary" aria-label="Lab summary">
      <p>City University of Hong Kong</p>
      <p>Cancer biology · Epigenetics · Spatial analysis · Digital pathology</p>
      <a href="/research/">Research</a>
      <a href="/members/">Members</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-feature">
  <div class="home-feature-inner">
    <figure class="home-feature-image">
      <img src="/assets/research/ai.webp" alt="Tissue section colour-coded into regions by AI-assisted analysis">
    </figure>
    <div class="home-feature-copy">
      <p class="home-number">01</p>
      <h2>Wet-dry cancer research with a translational focus</h2>
      <p>Building upon molecular experiments and moving from basic mechanisms toward clinical interventions, our laboratory integrates bioinformatics, spatial biology and advanced AI-assisted analyses to accelerate discovery.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-inner">
    <p class="home-number">02</p>
    <h2>Research directions</h2>

    <div class="home-research-list">
      {% for topic in research.topics %}
      <article class="home-research-item">
        <h3>{{ topic.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ topic.paragraphs[0] }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section-inner">
    <p class="home-number">03</p>
    <h2>Selected publications</h2>

    <div class="home-publication-list">
      {% for paper in publications.papers %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
      {% set link = paper.url if paper.url else "https://doi.org/" + paper.doi %}
      <article class="home-publication">
        <p class="home-publication-year">{{ paper.year }}</p>
        <h3><a href="{{ link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ paper.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ paper.journal }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="home-more"><a href="/publications/">All publications</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-contact">
  <div class="home-section-inner home-contact-inner">
    <p class="home-number">04</p>
    <h2>Join the lab</h2>
    <p>We welcome postdoctoral fellows, research assistants and postgraduate students interested in molecular cancer biology, spatial analysis, AI-assisted pathology and translational discovery.</p>
    <a href="/contact/">Contact Ming Lab</a>
  </div>
</section>
